  "The atmospheric/leakage case excludes only the already documented stray .noisier.T.cal artifact. Calibration channel axes use the same existing floating-point comparison as MS metadata; a regression accepts one ULP and rejects a one-hertz error. DATA/noise thresholds are unchanged."
